obs Final integration pulled both working remotes through 9e0b3bdc6c. Bakery's projection checks, Pheromone's language recovery, and Diffuser's research stay whole. Resolved four shared-record conflicts by retaining both recital entries, deriving the merged counts, and naming the new parent. September 7 now has 133 rows and September 8 has 166. Both recovered log blobs remain unchanged.
obs Regenerated both derived pages after the rebase; their bytes were already current. All seven living pins pass. Fourteen focused integration checks pass: four changed guard witnesses, three record witnesses, four link and capacity scans, the pin scan, the whole local projection witness, and its coverage reader. These are post-rebase checks; the full hot totals above belong to the pre-rebase tree.
